  colors: 2-3 distinct non-black colors (from palette 1-9)
  symmetry: input must NOT be left-right symmetric (ensures non-trivial output)
  transform: |
    tile = [fliplr(input) | input]
    output = [tile | tile]
    output is same height, 4x width
