0013:     """
0014:     Surround every gray pixel with a blue one-cell neighborhood while keeping the gray centers.
0015: 
0016:     Input structure:
0017:     - The grid is mostly black.
0018:     - Gray pixels are sparse markers to expand.
0019:     - Markers may lie near the grid edge.
