0021:     Rule:
0022:     - For each gray pixel, paint its clipped 3 by 3 neighborhood blue.
0023:     - Combine overlapping neighborhoods normally.
0024:     - Restore all original gray marker cells after painting blue.
0025: 
0026:     Key insight:
0027:     - Each gray pixel seeds a local halo, while the marker itself remains gray in the output.
